sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Contractor
    participant p1 as Catalog
    participant p2 as Lead API
    participant p3 as Vendor
    participant p4 as Quote Service
    participant p5 as Notification
    p0->>p1: Search equipment and emirate
    p1->>p2: Request quote
    p2->>p3: Ask to confirm current availability
    p3->>p2: Available / unavailable with details
    p2->>p4: Create versioned quotation
    p4->>p0: Show quote and expiry
    p0->>p2: Accept quotation
    p2->>p5: Notify supplier of intent
